1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:07,288
I have read every theory out there. None of them fit perfectly. And that is exactly what makes it perfect horror.

2
00:00:07,688 --> 00:00:13,568
The scariest stories are not the ones with monsters. They are the ones with loose ends.

3
00:00:15,768 --> 00:00:21,408
Loose ends that are still out there tonight. In New Jersey. On a quiet street. Watching.

4
00:00:21,808 --> 00:00:28,696
So if you ever find a letter with no return address, made out to The New Owner, do not open it on the porch.

5
00:00:29,096 --> 00:00:33,776
Open it inside. Lock every door. And check which bedrooms face the street.

6
00:00:34,176 --> 00:00:39,648
This has been Midnight Dread Tales. Real stories. Real dread. I will see you in the next one.

